{"nodes": [{"id": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_fable_mode", "label": "Skill /fable-mode \u2014 protocolo estricto", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ejecuta la tarea sin saltarse fases y anunciando cada una, para m\u00e1xima calidad en tareas dif\u00edciles."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_phase_contract", "label": "Fase 0 \u2014 Contrato", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reformular qu\u00e9 se pide, qu\u00e9 cuenta como \u00e9xito verificable y qu\u00e9 queda fuera. Es la \u00daNICA pregunta permitida; despu\u00e9s se trabaja aut\u00f3nomo."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_phase_reconnaissance", "label": "Fase 1 \u2014 Reconocimiento", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Antes de opinar o planificar hay que mirar el terreno real y verificar contra el c\u00f3digo cada supuesto barato de verificar (firmas, campos, versiones)."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_phase_plan", "label": "Fase 2 \u2014 Plan", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pasos numerados, archivos que toca cada paso y c\u00f3mo se verificar\u00e1 cada uno, m\u00e1s riesgo principal y plan B en una l\u00ednea."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_phase_execution", "label": "Fase 3 \u2014 Ejecuci\u00f3n", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Si la realidad contradice el plan, se detiene, se ajusta y se dice; no se fuerza el plan muerto."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_phase_adversarial_verification", "label": "Fase 4 \u2014 Verificaci\u00f3n adversarial", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Atacar el propio trabajo: qu\u00e9 input lo rompe, qu\u00e9 caso borde falta, qu\u00e9 archivo relacionado (tests, docs, imports, config) se olvid\u00f3."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_phase_delivery", "label": "Fase 5 \u2014 Entrega", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reportar qu\u00e9 se hizo, la evidencia real de verificaci\u00f3n y qu\u00e9 qued\u00f3 expl\u00edcitamente sin verificar. Honestidad total sobre el estado."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_mode_prohibitions", "label": "Prohibiciones del modo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prohibido declarar \u00e9xito sin output observado, inventar firmas de API, decir 'deber\u00eda funcionar' o dejar TODOs silenciosos."}], "edges": [{"source": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_fable_mode", "target": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_phase_contract", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-mode/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_fable_mode", "target": "_claude_skills_fable_mode_skill_phase_reconnaissance", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED"